OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand scattered showers in the evening,
OL,7,Fa few of these heavy at first. Clear
OL,8,Fspells and showers overnight, staying
OL,9,Fdriest in the southeast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FBright spells and a few
OL,12,Fshowers in the morning, these mainly
OL,13,Fover Antrim. Cloud spilling east in
OL,14,Fthe afternoon before occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy rain pushes east in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
